'<p>',
'Reference a database directory and file on the database server. Format: DIRECTORY:FILENAME e.g. AOP_TEMPLATE:my_template.docx',
'</p>'))
,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
